-- Monteva Hua Hin (PROJECT-001): spec list from "Monteva_Project_Villa_Specifications_Rev02",
-- tab ตารางวัสดุอุปกรณ์ (draft 7 Nov 2026). Quantities are per house; blank = not known yet.
-- Prices are not in the document yet. Removes the earlier 44-item starter list (only rows nobody
-- has edited and no unit uses); anything added or changed in the app is kept. Safe to run again.
